        <choice no="4" is_answer="false">5.0</choice>
      </choices>
      <answer source="정답표" cross_check="">1</answer>
      <explanation_ref file="화학공학일반_해설.xml" question_no="1">[정답 1번] 수치/계산 도출형 (수리·계산·자료해석형) | 핵심어: 아음속(subsonic) | 정답 선지: 0.5</explanation_ref>
    </question>
